# N-Eye — Evidence

Use only: `IMPLEMENTED` | `TESTED` | `VERIFIED IN REAL RUNTIME` | `MEASURED` | `TARGET` | `UNVERIFIED` | `NOT_IMPLEMENTED`.

- Documentation says it exists ≠ verified implementation.
- Code exists ≠ runtime works.
- Test exists ≠ requirement proven.
- Build passes ≠ browser behavior verified.
- Mock passes ≠ real provider verified.
- UI says protected ≠ privacy proven.
- Development measurement ≠ formal SIH benchmark.
- Previous agent said PASS ≠ PASS.
- No evidence = UNVERIFIED.

Never invent metrics. Never claim Chrome Side Panel E2E without loading the unpacked extension. Never print provider API keys.
